{
  "id": "2023_数理学府_MMAコース_問3",
  "school": "九州大学",
  "year": 2023,
  "subject": "数理学府_MMAコース_問3",
  "text": "设 $c$ 为正常数。考虑二维连续型随机变量 $(X, Y)$，联合概率密度函数为\n$$f_{X,Y}(x,y) = \\begin{cases} c & (0 \\leq x \\leq 1 \\text{ 且 } x \\leq y \\leq x+1) \\\\ 0 & (\\text{其他}) \\end{cases}$$\n回答下列问题。\n\n(1) 求 $c$ 的值。\n\n(2) 求 $X$ 的边缘概率密度函数、期望和方差。\n\n(3) 求 $Y$ 的边缘概率密度函数、期望和方差。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "概率统计",
    "二维联合密度",
    "边缘密度",
    "条件密度",
    "期望",
    "方差"
  ],
  "question_type": "二维连续型随机变量的联合与边缘分布",
  "method": [
    "联合密度归一化",
    "边缘密度积分",
    "期望积分"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "(1) 积分 = 1 求 c",
    "(2) 对 y 积分得 $f_X(x)$",
    "(3) 对 x 积分得 $f_Y(y)$"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "bivariate_continuous_distribution",
    "template": "∫∫f=1; f_X(x)=∫f(x,y)dy; E[X]=∫xf_X",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(1) c 值",
      "steps": [
        "$\\int_0^1 \\int_x^{x+1} c \\, dy \\, dx = c \\int_0^1 1 \\, dx = c = 1$。",
        "$c = 1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2) X 的边缘密度等",
      "steps": [
        "$f_X(x) = \\int_x^{x+1} 1 \\, dy = 1$，$0 \\leq x \\leq 1$。",
        "$X \\sim U(0,1)$。",
        "$E[X] = 1/2$，$\\text{Var}(X) = 1/12$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(3) Y 的边缘密度等",
      "steps": [
        "$f_Y(y) = \\int_{\\max(0,y-1)}^{\\min(1,y)} 1 \\, dx$。",
        "若 $0 \\leq y \\leq 1$：$f_Y(y) = y$。",
        "若 $1 < y \\leq 2$：$f_Y(y) = 1 - (y-1) = 2-y$。",
        "$f_Y(y) = \\begin{cases} y & 0 \\leq y \\leq 1 \\\\ 2-y & 1 < y \\leq 2 \\\\ 0 & \\text{其他} \\end{cases}$",
        "$E[Y] = \\int_0^1 y \\cdot y \\, dy + \\int_1^2 y(2-y) \\, dy = 1/3 + (2 \\cdot 3/2 - 7/3) = 1/3 + 2/3 = 1$。",
        "$\\text{Var}(Y) = E[Y^2] - 1$。$E[Y^2] = \\int_0^1 y^3 dy + \\int_1^2 y^2(2-y) dy = 1/4 + (2 \\cdot 7/3 - 15/4) = 1/4 + 1/12 + ... = 7/6$。",
        "$\\text{Var}(Y) = 7/6 - 1 = 1/6$。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
